       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           I D E N T I F I C A T I O N   D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM NAME
      ******************************************************************
       PROGRAM-ID. SWB4015.
      ******************************************************************
      *                                                                *
      *                      - MENSAGENS SWIFT -                       *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
      * Formatação de Chaves de movimentos (Ctas Corresp)              *
      ******************************************************************
      *           L O G     D E     A L T E R A C O E S                *
      ******************************************************************
      *  INICIO  * AUTOR  * FIM    *  C O M E N T A R I O S            *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      *          *        *        *                                   *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *           E N V I R O N M E N T         D I V I S I O N        *
      ******************************************************************
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                     CONFIGURATION SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
           CLASS NUMER                '0' THRU '9'.
      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                      INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION                      *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE-CONTROL.
      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                   D A T A   D I V I S I O N                    *
      ******************************************************************
       FILE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                          FILE SECTION                          *
      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *                    WORKING STORAGE SECTION                     *
      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER              PIC X(40) VALUE 'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE'.
      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM CONTROL
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWB4015'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * TABELAS
      ******************************************************************
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7204  END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCDPARAM END-EXEC.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * APIS
      ******************************************************************
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * CONSTANTES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT7204                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWVT7204'.
           05 CON-SWM04015                 PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWM04015'.
           05 CON-SWPARAM                  PIC  X(10) VALUE 'SWPARAM'.
      *
           05 CON-BMOC                     PIC  X(04) VALUE 'BMOC'.
           05 CON-DLIMITE                  PIC  9(08) VALUE 20190424.
           05 CON-PRPARAM                  PIC  X(10) VALUE
                                                        'EXESWB4015'.
           05 CON-RECUPERA                 PIC  X(01) VALUE 'R'.
           05 CON-PD                       PIC  X(02) VALUE 'PD'.

      *    05 CON-STF                      PIC  X(04) VALUE 'STF'.
      *    05 CON-MTR                      PIC  X(04) VALUE 'MTR'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * VARIAVEIS
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-PARAGRAPH-NAME            PIC  X(30) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-CODIGO                    PIC  X(03) VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-X                         PIC S9(04) COMP VALUE 0.
           05 WS-DATE-START                PIC  X(10) VALUE SPACES.
      *
      *    05 WS-STR1                      PIC  X(200).
      *    05 WS-STR2                      PIC  X(200).
      *    05 WS-STR3                      PIC  X(200).
      *
      *    05 WS-POS                       PIC S9(03) COMP-3.
      *    05 WS-LEN                       PIC S9(03) COMP-3.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * SWITCHES
      ******************************************************************
       01  WS-SWITCHES.
           05 SW-SWT72                     PIC S9(04) COMP VALUE  0.
              88 SW-SWT72-OK                               VALUE  0.
              88 SW-SWT72-END                              VALUE -1.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * COPYS
      ******************************************************************
           COPY AQCL0001.
           COPY AQCK0001.
           COPY SWCK0002.
           COPY SWCK0003.
           COPY SWCL5000.
           COPY SWCL4015.
           COPY SWCW4015.
           COPY VIAW0050.
           COPY VIAW0030.
           COPY VIAL0015.
           COPY BRCL1020.
           COPY AQCW0109.
      *    COPY AQCW0009.
           COPY AQCW0011.
           COPY SXCL1000.
           COPY ETCL9221.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      * DB2
      ******************************************************************
      *
           EXEC SQL
              DECLARE CRS_SWT72    CURSOR WITH HOLD FOR
                 SELECT MRBALC
                      , MRCCB
                      , NCCCCBAN
                      , NCCCCSPAI
                      , NCCCCCONTA
                      , MRTDOC
                      , MRCOPE
                      , MRNDOC
                      , MRVLR
                      , MRSALD
                      , MRUSER
                      , MRDTSIS
                      , MRHORA
                      , MRDATL
                      , MRDRCX
                      , MRETRB
                      , MRBALM
                      , MROBS
                      , MRNOPR
                      , MRNOPS
                      , MRNORD
                      , MREANL
                      , MRDTCB
                      , MREXCT
                      , MRMOED
                      , MRDMOV
                      , GBMRINFC
                      , CCHAVE
                      , IRECONC
                      , CCODMSG
                      , DATVAL
                      , COSN
                      , COSNC
                      , CREF
                      , CREFOPR
                      , CTIPREC
                      , GOBS
                      , CUSERID
                      , HTIMEST
                   FROM SWVT7204
                  WHERE MRDATL   >= :SWCD7204-MRDATL
                    AND CCODEST  =  :SWCD7204-CCODEST
                    AND CCHAVE   =  :SWCD7204-CCHAVE
           END-EXEC.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40)
                                         VALUE 'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE'.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      ******************************************************************
      *                        LINKAGE SECTION                         *
      ******************************************************************
       LINKAGE SECTION.
           COPY AQCW0009.

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING AQCW0009-DATA.

      ******************************************************************
      *              P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N               *
      ******************************************************************
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT
             UNTIL SW-SWT72-END
                OR NOT AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS.
      *
           PERFORM 3000-FIM-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           GOBACK.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           INITIALIZE WS-VARIAVEIS         REPLACING NUMERIC BY ZEROES
                                                ALPHANUMERIC BY SPACES.
      *
           SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-OK          TO TRUE.
      *
           PERFORM AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ
              THRU AQCP0100-OBT-DADOS-ARQ-EXIT.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-INICIO
                 THRU AQCP0100-REG-INICIO-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 1100-OBTER-EXECUCAO
                 THRU 1199-OBTER-EXECUCAO-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 4100-ABRIR-SWT72
                 THRU 4199-ABRIR-SWT72-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 4200-LER-SWT72
                 THRU 4299-LER-SWT72-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       1100-OBTER-EXECUCAO.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '1100-OBTER-EXECUCAO'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE AQCW0100-AT-DTOP           TO AQCW0005-DT98.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10             TO WS-DATE-START.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SET  :WS-DATE-START = DATE( :WS-DATE-START ) - 3 DAYS
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE WS-DATE-START              TO AQCW0005-DTX10.
           PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
              THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.
           MOVE AQCW0005-DT98              TO SWCD7204-MRDATL.
      *
           MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC            TO SWPARAM-PRCODPAR.
           MOVE CON-PRPARAM                TO SWPARAM-PRPARAM.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT PRVALALF
                   , PRVALDAT
                INTO :SWPARAM-PRVALALF
                   , :SWPARAM-PRVALDAT
                FROM SWPARAM
               WHERE PRCODPAR  =  :SWPARAM-PRCODPAR
                 AND PRPARAM   =  :SWPARAM-PRPARAM
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWPARAM               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 IF SWPARAM-PRVALALF EQUAL CON-RECUPERA
                    MOVE SWPARAM-PRVALDAT  TO SWCD7204-MRDATL
                 END-IF
              WHEN OTHER
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                      VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR   TO TRUE
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro OBTER Exec'    TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                 PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                    THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       1199-OBTER-EXECUCAO-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'       TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 5100-FORMATAR-CHAVE
              THRU 5199-FORMATAR-CHAVE-EXIT.
      *
           IF  SWCD7204-CCHAVE   NOT EQUAL SPACES
              PERFORM 5200-ACTUALIZAR-CHAVE
                 THRU 5299-ACTUALIZAR-CHAVE-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 4200-LER-SWT72
                 THRU 4299-LER-SWT72-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       3000-FIM-PROGRAMA.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '3000-FIM-PROGRAMA'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE 'AQCW0009-RCODE'        TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE AQCW0009-RCODE          TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 4300-FECHAR-SWT72
              THRU 4399-FECHAR-SWT72-EXIT.
      *
           PERFORM AQCP0009-TRATA-RCODE
              THRU AQCP0009-TRATA-RCODE-EXIT.
      *
           PERFORM AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT
              THRU AQCP0002-TRATA-SYNCPOINT-EXIT.
      *
           IF AQCW0009-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM AQCP0100-REG-FIM
                 THRU AQCP0100-REG-FIM-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       3099-FIM-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       4100-ABRIR-SWT72.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '4100-ABRIR-SWT72'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           SET  SW-SWT72-OK                TO TRUE.
      *
      *    MOVE SWCK0002-NAO               TO SWCD7204-IRECONC.
           MOVE CON-PD                     TO SWCD7204-CCODEST.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CCHAVE.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              OPEN CRS_SWT72
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT7204              TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           IF NOT AQCW0011-OK
              SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                   VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR      TO TRUE
              MOVE WS-PROGNAME             TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
              MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID      TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME     TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
              MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE        TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
              MOVE 'Erro OPEN Cursor'      TO VIAW0030-DESC1
              PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                 THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
       4199-ABRIR-SWT72-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       4200-LER-SWT72.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '4200-LER-SWT72'           TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              FETCH CRS_SWT72
               INTO :SWCD7204-MRBALC
                  , :SWCD7204-MRCCB
                  , :SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN
                  , :SWCD7204-NCCCCSPAI
                  , :SWCD7204-NCCCCCONTA
                  , :SWCD7204-MRTDOC
                  , :SWCD7204-MRCOPE
                  , :SWCD7204-MRNDOC
                  , :SWCD7204-MRVLR
                  , :SWCD7204-MRSALD
                  , :SWCD7204-MRUSER
                  , :SWCD7204-MRDTSIS
                  , :SWCD7204-MRHORA
                  , :SWCD7204-MRDATL
                  , :SWCD7204-MRDRCX
                  , :SWCD7204-MRETRB
                  , :SWCD7204-MRBALM
                  , :SWCD7204-MROBS
                  , :SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                  , :SWCD7204-MRNOPS
                  , :SWCD7204-MRNORD
                  , :SWCD7204-MREANL
                  , :SWCD7204-MRDTCB
                  , :SWCD7204-MREXCT
                  , :SWCD7204-MRMOED
                  , :SWCD7204-MRDMOV
                  , :SWCD7204-GBMRINFC
                  , :SWCD7204-CCHAVE
                  , :SWCD7204-IRECONC
                  , :SWCD7204-CCODMSG
                  , :SWCD7204-DATVAL
                  , :SWCD7204-COSN
                  , :SWCD7204-COSNC
                  , :SWCD7204-CREF
                  , :SWCD7204-CREFOPR
                  , :SWCD7204-CTIPREC
                  , :SWCD7204-GOBS
                  , :SWCD7204-CUSERID
                  , :SWCD7204-HTIMEST
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-OK
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN AQCW0011-NOTFND
                 SET  SW-SWT72-END         TO TRUE
              WHEN OTHER
                SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL
                     VIAW0030-DB2-ERROR    TO TRUE
                MOVE WS-PROGNAME           TO VIAW0030-PGMNAME
                MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID    TO VIAW0030-PARAGRAPH-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME   TO VIAW0030-TABLE-NAME
                MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE      TO VIAW0030-SQLCODE
                MOVE 'Erro FETCH Cursor'   TO VIAW0030-DESC1
                PERFORM VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL
                   THRU VIAP0030-ESCREVE-SPOOL-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       4299-LER-SWT72-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       4300-FECHAR-SWT72.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '4200-FECHAR-SWT72'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              CLOSE CRS_SWT72
           END-EXEC.
      *
       4399-FECHAR-SWT72-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
       5100-FORMATAR-CHAVE.
      ******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '5100-FORMATAR-CHAVE'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCD7204-MRDMOV            TO SWCL4015-STRING
           CALL CON-SWM04015  USING  SWCL4015-REC
           MOVE SWCL4015-CCHAVE            TO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *
           PERFORM 5110-STF-MTR-MOC
              THRU 5110-STF-MTR-MOC-EXIT.
      *
       5199-FORMATAR-CHAVE-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *

      ******************************************************************
       5110-STF-MTR-MOC.
      ******************************************************************
           MOVE '5110-STF-MTR-MOC'         TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
           IF ( AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM )
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF ( SWCD7204-NCCCCBAN   = CON-BMOC     AND
                SWCD7204-MRDATL     > CON-DLIMITE  AND
      *         SWCD7204-MROBS(1:1) IS NUMER )
                FUNCTION TRIM(SWCD7204-MROBS) IS NUMER )

      *       MOVE SWCD7204-MRDMOV         TO WS-STR1
      ** STF
      *       MOVE CON-STF                 TO WS-STR2
      *       PERFORM 5120-STRCHR1
      *          THRU 5120-STRCHR1-EXIT
      *       IF ( WS-POS > 0 )
      *          MOVE SWCD7204-MROBS       TO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *       END-IF
      ** MTR
      *       MOVE CON-MTR                 TO WS-STR2
      *       PERFORM 5120-STRCHR1
      *          THRU 5120-STRCHR1-EXIT
      *       IF ( WS-POS > 0 )
      *          MOVE SWCD7204-MROBS       TO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *       END-IF

              MOVE SWCD7204-MROBS          TO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
           END-IF.

       5110-STF-MTR-MOC-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
      *5120-STRCHR1.
      ******************************************************************
      * Char search in string (1-based)
      ******************************************************************
      *    MOVE '5120-STRCHR1'             TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID.
      *    IF ( AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM )
      *       PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *          THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *    END-IF.
      *
      *    INITIALIZE WS-POS.
      *    UNSTRING     WS-STR1
      *    DELIMITED BY WS-STR2(1:3)
      *            INTO WS-STR3
      *        COUNT IN WS-POS
      *    END-UNSTRING.
      *
      *    ADD 1 TO WS-POS.
      *
      **not found (0)
      *    IF WS-POS > LENGTH OF WS-STR1
      *       MOVE 0 TO WS-POS
      *    END-IF.
      *
      *5120-STRCHR1-EXIT.
      *    EXIT.

      ******************************************************************
      *51000-FORMATAR-CHAVE-OLD.
      ******************************************************************
      **
      *     MOVE '51000-FORMATAR-CHAVE-OLD'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      **
      *     IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
      *        PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *           THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     EVALUATE TRUE
      *        WHEN SWCD7204-MRDMOV( 10 : 9 ) EQUAL '/TRF-CORR'
      *           STRING 'TRF-CO/'          DELIMITED BY SIZE
      *              SWCD7204-MRDMOV( 1 : 9 )
      *                                     DELIMITED BY SPACE
      *                                   INTO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *        WHEN SWCD7204-MRDMOV( 1 : 3 ) EQUAL 'OPI'
      *           STRING SWCD7204-MRDMOV    DELIMITED BY SPACE
      *                                   INTO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *        WHEN SWCD7204-MRDMOV( 1 : 3 ) EQUAL 'CDI'
      *           STRING SWCD7204-MRDMOV    DELIMITED BY SPACE
      *                                   INTO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *        WHEN SWCD7204-MRDMOV( 1 : 3 ) EQUAL 'OPM'
      *           STRING SWCD7204-MRDMOV    DELIMITED BY SPACE
      *                                   INTO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *        WHEN SWCD7204-MRDMOV( 1 : 3 ) EQUAL 'OPR'
      *           STRING SWCD7204-MRDMOV    DELIMITED BY SPACE
      *                                   INTO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *        WHEN SWCD7204-MRDMOV( 1 : 3 ) EQUAL 'SPO'
      *           STRING SWCD7204-MRDMOV    DELIMITED BY SPACE
      *                                   INTO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *        WHEN SWCD7204-MRDMOV( 1 : 3 ) EQUAL 'RDI'
      *           STRING SWCD7204-MRDMOV    DELIMITED BY SPACE
      *                                   INTO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *        WHEN SWCD7204-MRDMOV( 1 : 3 ) EQUAL 'CQA'
      *           STRING SWCD7204-MRDMOV    DELIMITED BY SPACE
      *                                   INTO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *        WHEN SWCD7204-MRDMOV( 1 : 3 ) EQUAL 'EMP'
      *           STRING SWCD7204-MRDMOV    DELIMITED BY SPACE
      *                                   INTO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *        WHEN SWCD7204-MRDMOV( 1 : 3 ) EQUAL 'RD-'
      *           STRING SWCD7204-MRDMOV    DELIMITED BY SPACE
      *                                   INTO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *        WHEN OTHER
      *           PERFORM 6100-PROCURAR-CODIGOS
      *              THRU 6199-PROCURAR-CODIGOS-EXIT
      *     END-EVALUATE.
      **
      * 51999-FORMATAR-CHAVE-OLD-EXIT.
      *     EXIT.
      **
      *******************************************************************
       5200-ACTUALIZAR-CHAVE.
      *******************************************************************
      *
           MOVE '5200-ACTUALIZAR-CHAVE'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      *
           IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
              PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD7204-CUSERID.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT7204
                 SET CCHAVE   =  :SWCD7204-CCHAVE
                   , CUSERID  =  :SWCD7204-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST  =  CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               WHERE MRNOPR   =  :SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                 AND MRNORD   =  :SWCD7204-MRNORD
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT
      *
           EVALUATE TRUE
              WHEN DB2-OK
              WHEN DB2-DUPREC
                 CONTINUE
              WHEN OTHER
                 MOVE WS-PROGNAME          TO AQCW0100-PGMNAME
                 SET  AQCW0009-RCODE-APL   TO TRUE
                 MOVE VIAL0015-CALLER-ID   TO AQCW0100-PARAGRAPH
                 MOVE AQCW0011-TABLE-NAME  TO AQCW0100-NM-ENTIDADE
                 MOVE AQCW0011-SQLCODE     TO AQCW0100-SQLCODE
                 MOVE 'Erro UPDATE tabela' TO AQCW0100-DESC1
                 PERFORM AQCP0100-ESCREVE-MSG
                    THRU AQCP0100-ESCREVE-MSG-EXIT
           END-EVALUATE.
      *
       5299-ACTUALIZAR-CHAVE-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *
      ******************************************************************
      *6100-PROCURAR-CODIGOS.
      ******************************************************************
      **
      *     MOVE '6100-PROCURAR-CODIGOS'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      **
      *     IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
      *        PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *           THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     PERFORM 6130-PROCURAR-ACQUIRER
      *        THRU 6139-PROCURAR-ACQUIRER-EXIT.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE 'OPI'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6110-PROCURAR-PREFIXO
      *           THRU 6119-PROCURAR-PREFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE 'OPM'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6110-PROCURAR-PREFIXO
      *           THRU 6119-PROCURAR-PREFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE 'OPR'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6110-PROCURAR-PREFIXO
      *           THRU 6119-PROCURAR-PREFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE 'EXT'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6110-PROCURAR-PREFIXO
      *           THRU 6119-PROCURAR-PREFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE 'CQA'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6110-PROCURAR-PREFIXO
      *           THRU 6119-PROCURAR-PREFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE 'CDI'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6110-PROCURAR-PREFIXO
      *           THRU 6119-PROCURAR-PREFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE 'SUB'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6110-PROCURAR-PREFIXO
      *           THRU 6119-PROCURAR-PREFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE 'GAR'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6110-PROCURAR-PREFIXO
      *           THRU 6119-PROCURAR-PREFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE 'GAB'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6110-PROCURAR-PREFIXO
      *           THRU 6119-PROCURAR-PREFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE 'SPO'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6110-PROCURAR-PREFIXO
      *           THRU 6119-PROCURAR-PREFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE '/TR'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6120-PROCURAR-SUFIXO
      *           THRU 6129-PROCURAR-SUFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE 'TRF'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6110-PROCURAR-PREFIXO
      *           THRU 6119-PROCURAR-PREFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE '/CE'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6120-PROCURAR-SUFIXO
      *           THRU 6129-PROCURAR-SUFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE '/IM'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6120-PROCURAR-SUFIXO
      *           THRU 6129-PROCURAR-SUFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE '/SW'                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6120-PROCURAR-SUFIXO
      *           THRU 6129-PROCURAR-SUFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-CCHAVE EQUAL SPACES
      *        MOVE '/C '                   TO WS-CODIGO
      *        PERFORM 6120-PROCURAR-SUFIXO
      *           THRU 6129-PROCURAR-SUFIXO-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      * 6199-PROCURAR-CODIGOS-EXIT.
      *     EXIT.
      **
      ******************************************************************
      *6110-PROCURAR-PREFIXO.
      ******************************************************************
      **
      *     MOVE '6110-PROCURAR-PREFIXO'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      **
      *     IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
      *        PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *           THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     MOVE ZEROES                     TO WS-X.
      **
      *     INSPECT SWCD7204-MRDMOV TALLYING WS-X
      *        FOR ALL WS-CODIGO.
      **
      *     IF WS-X GREATER THAN ZEROES
      *        PERFORM VARYING WS-X
      *           FROM +1 BY +1
      *          UNTIL SWCD7204-MRDMOV( WS-X : 3 ) EQUAL WS-CODIGO
      *           CONTINUE
      *        END-PERFORM
      **
      *        PERFORM VARYING WS-X
      *           FROM WS-X  BY +1
      *          UNTIL WS-X GREATER THAN +40
      *             OR SWCD7204-MRDMOV( WS-X : 1 ) EQUAL SPACE
      *           STRING SWCD7204-CCHAVE    DELIMITED BY SPACE
      *                  SWCD7204-MRDMOV( WS-X : 1 )
      *                                     DELIMITED BY SIZE
      *                                   INTO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *        END-PERFORM
      **
      *     END-IF.
      **
      * 6119-PROCURAR-PREFIXO-EXIT.
      *     EXIT.
      **
      ******************************************************************
      *6120-PROCURAR-SUFIXO.
      ******************************************************************
      **
      *     MOVE '6120-PROCURAR-SUFIXO'     TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      **
      *     IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
      *        PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *           THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     MOVE ZEROES                     TO WS-X.
      **
      *     INSPECT SWCD7204-MRDMOV TALLYING WS-X
      *        FOR ALL WS-CODIGO.
      **
      *     IF SWCD7204-MRDMOV( 1 : 3 ) NOT EQUAL    WS-CODIGO AND
      *                             WS-X GREATER THAN ZEROES
      *        PERFORM VARYING WS-X
      *           FROM +1 BY +1
      *          UNTIL SWCD7204-MRDMOV( WS-X : 3 ) EQUAL WS-CODIGO
      *             OR WS-X GREATER THAN +37
      *           STRING SWCD7204-CCHAVE    DELIMITED BY SPACE
      *                  SWCD7204-MRDMOV( WS-X : 1 )
      *                                     DELIMITED BY SIZE
      *                                   INTO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *        END-PERFORM
      **
      *        PERFORM VARYING WS-X
      *           FROM WS-X  BY +1
      *          UNTIL SWCD7204-MRDMOV( WS-X : 1 ) EQUAL SPACE
      *             OR WS-X GREATER THAN +40
      *           STRING SWCD7204-CCHAVE    DELIMITED BY SPACE
      *                  SWCD7204-MRDMOV( WS-X : 1 )
      *                                     DELIMITED BY SIZE
      *                                   INTO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *        END-PERFORM
      **
      *     END-IF.
      **
      * 6129-PROCURAR-SUFIXO-EXIT.
      *     EXIT.
      **
      ******************************************************************
      *6130-PROCURAR-ACQUIRER.
      ******************************************************************
      **
      *     MOVE '6130-PROCURAR-ACQUIRER'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
      **
      *     IF AQCW0100-AT-DEBUG-SIM
      *        PERFORM VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG
      *           THRU VIAP0015-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
      *     END-IF.
      **
      *     MOVE ZEROES                     TO WS-X.
      **
      *     INSPECT SWCD7204-MRDMOV TALLYING WS-X
      *        FOR ALL 'ACQUIRER'.
      **
      *     IF WS-X GREATER THAN ZEROES
      *        MOVE SWCD7204-MRDMOV( 35 : 6 )
      *                                     TO SWCD7204-CCHAVE
      *     END-IF.
      **
      * 6139-PROCURAR-ACQUIRER-EXIT.
      *     EXIT.
      **
      ******************************************************************
      *    EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP9999 END-EXEC
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE AQCP0002 END-EXEC
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY VIAP0030.
           COPY AQCP0011.
           COPY AQCP0109.
           COPY AQCP0009.
           COPY SXCP1000.
           COPY ETCP9221.
      ******************************************************************
